  "answer": "This feature request has been filed before, so yours is a duplicate. PowerToys#20306 (Quick Accent: show toolbar close to text cursor) is the main ticket. The other tickets were closed as duplicates of it or of each other: #24627, #28505 and #24098. It is still open as a feature request, and I found no fix or release date in the archive. For now, Quick Accent only offers fixed toolbar positions. Open Quick Accent in PowerToys Settings and choose the position closest to where you usually type. To help get this built, add a thumbs-up or a comment on #20306. Your idea of placing the bar above or below the textbox, depending on available space, matches what people have asked for there. One commenter on #24627 also suggested a toggle between fixed and relative positioning, so people who prefer the bar at the bottom can keep it there."
